# Playwright
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# graphify: the graph itself is committed (it is the project's map), but the
# machine-local and regenerable parts are not.
#   .graphify_python / .graphify_root hold absolute paths to THIS machine and
#   would be wrong in any other clone.
#   cache/ is an extraction cache, rebuilt on demand.
#   YYYY-MM-DD/ are automatic pre-update backups of the graph.
#   cost.json is a local token-spend log, not project data.
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
graphify-out/cost.json

# Large saved-page reference files (6-17MB each) used only as visual
# reference early in the project — not part of the Next.js app. Named
# explicitly rather than a blanket *.html rule so a real future HTML asset
# (e.g. under public/) doesn't get silently swallowed.
/1：09 Portfolio (8_8_2026 17：01：43).html
/1：09 Portfolio (8_8_2026 20：33：04).html
/NEWS ｜ Alche, Inc (8_8_2026 20：35：08).html
